{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Don\u2019t Fowl Down</strong> is a climbing game where failure is part of the fun.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a flightless chicken on a desperate climb for love after falling from the clouds. <br>Scramble your way up brutal obstacles, earn coins, buy silly consumables, and brace yourself for the inevitable fall.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb absurd heights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn coins from near-death acrobatics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fall</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase consumables that will help you on your next attempt</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repeat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932650/extras/21ca4e3555597dadd4f60be82d2a688f.poster.avif?t=1756235849\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932650/extras/21ca4e3555597dadd4f60be82d2a688f.webm?t=1756235849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932650/extras/21ca4e3555597dadd4f60be82d2a688f.mp4?t=1756235849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>When a chicken\u2019s dreamy day in the clouds is interrupted by a dazzling stranger flying by, he leaps for love... but his wings betray him, sending him spiraling down. Now, grounded and determined, he must scramble and climb his way back up to win her heart. Will you conquer the heights and prove love is worth the fall?</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3932650?t=1756235849","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3932650?t=1756235849","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932650/4e3b9119ef014a50eda69b88180ee36ae2ca2bfd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756235849","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932650/4e3b9119ef014a50eda69b88180ee36ae2ca2bfd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756235849","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Don\u2019t Fowl Down</strong> is a climbing game where failure is part of the fun.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a flightless chicken on a desperate climb for love after falling from the clouds. <br>Scramble your way up brutal obstacles, earn coins, buy silly consumables, and brace yourself for the inevitable fall.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb absurd heights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn coins from near-death acrobatics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fall</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase consumables that will help you on your next attempt</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repeat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932650/extras/21ca4e3555597dadd4f60be82d2a688f.poster.avif?t=1756235849\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932650/extras/21ca4e3555597dadd4f60be82d2a688f.webm?t=1756235849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932650/extras/21ca4e3555597dadd4f60be82d2a688f.mp4?t=1756235849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></sp